{"id":"163292","t":{"th":"ตาลุงนักผจญภัยมือใหม่ฝึกโหดจนไร้เทียมทานกับปาร์ตี้ในตำนานขั้นเทพ","ro":"Shinmai Ossan Bouken-sha, Saikyou Party ni Shinu Hodo Kitaerarete Muteki ni Naru.","en":"The Ossan Newbie Adventurer, Trained to Death by the Most Powerful Party, Became Invincible","na":"新米オッサン冒険者、最強パーティに死ぬほど鍛えられて無敵になる。"},"cover":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx163292-1DkPP4r5UI9Y.jpg","coverM":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx163292-1DkPP4r5UI9Y.jpg","color":"#f1ae50","banner":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/163292-XOC86gRVHGOo.jpg","fmt":"TV","status":"FINISHED","eps":12,"dur":24,"season":"SUMMER","year":2024,"start":"2024-07-02","country":"JP","genres":["Action","Adventure","Comedy","Fantasy"],"score":73,"pop":83291,"studio":"Yumeta Company","desc":"\"Why should it matter how old you are if you want to start something new?\"\n\nThe strongest guy around, who also happens to be middle-aged, strives to be an adventurer! Everyone seems to think you should pursue your dreams while you're still young, but there's one man who just can't give up. In a world where most people who become adventurers do so in their teens, a guild employee in his thirties, Rick Gladiator, seeks to become an adventurer instead. After receiving unimaginably brutal training from the legendary party renowned as the strongest on the continent, Orichalcum Fist, he ends up with combat abilities worthy of S-rank status despite starting out as an F-rank rookie!","descTh":"“ทำไมคุณถึงอายุเท่าไหร่ถ้าคุณต้องการเริ่มต้นสิ่งใหม่ๆ”\n\nชายที่แข็งแกร่งที่สุดซึ่งบังเอิญเป็นวัยกลางคนเหมือนกัน มุ่งมั่นที่จะเป็นนักผจญภัย! ดูเหมือนทุกคนจะคิดว่าคุณควรไล่ตามความฝันในขณะที่คุณยังเด็ก แต่มีผู้ชายคนหนึ่งที่ยอมแพ้ไม่ได้ ในโลกที่คนส่วนใหญ่ที่กลายเป็นนักผจญภัยทำแบบนั้นในช่วงวัยรุ่น Rick Gladiator พนักงานกิลด์ในวัยสามสิบเศษ พยายามที่จะเป็นนักผจญภัยแทน หลังจากได้รับการฝึกฝนอันโหดร้ายอย่างเหลือเชื่อจากปาร์ตี้ในตำนานที่โด่งดังว่าแข็งแกร่งที่สุดในทวีปอย่าง Orichalcum Fist เขาก็จบลงด้วยความสามารถในการต่อสู้ที่คู่ควรกับสถานะระดับ S แม้ว่าจะเริ่มต้นจากการเป็นมือใหม่ระดับ F ก็ตาม!","src":{"meta":"anilist","th":"licensor","descTh":"gtranslate"},"trailer":"5USVeNWB_rk","al":"https://anilist.co/anime/163292","mal":"https://myanimelist.net/anime/54913","jp":null,"sched":[],"prov":[{"p":"muse_thdub","r":"TH","u":"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLU2oFbp2kofRdT9HHLB5UoypOUZMO8qMp","lang":"dub","eps":[["7","y:OfcwGNpt5fU",1761912986,"~",null,null,{"d":1425,"sk":[[125.0,214.0],[1335.0,1424.0]]}],["8","y:bNkNThWYuy0",1761912986,"~",null,null,{"d":1426,"sk":[[41.0,131.0],[1335.6,1424.0]]}],["9","y:o8KHEBdQJdM",1761912986,"~",null,null,{"d":1426,"sk":[[107.6,195.0],[1335.6,1424.1]]}],["10","y:kEdqu35kd7Q",1761912986,"~",null,null,{"d":1425,"sk":[[1367.2,1424.0]]}],["11","y:8hrw7uBhGYs",1761912986,"~",null,null,{"d":1425,"sk":[[1335.0,1424.0]]}],["12","y:yHI8e3JHxWs",1761912986,"~",null,null,{"d":1425,"fin":1}],["6","y:YONbwETxqcw",1746273606,"x",null,null,{"d":1425,"sk":[[83.5,171.0],[1287.6,1376.2]]}],["5","y:VP4deOsn4-o",1746187206,"x",null,null,{"d":1425,"sk":[[55.4,145.0],[1335.5,1424.0]]}],["4","y:o240DjyJ52w",1746100806,"x",null,null,{"d":1425,"sk":[[113.5,201.0],[1335.0,1424.0]]}],["3","y:Izn-w2xMGM8",1746014406,"x",null,null,{"d":1425,"sk":[[86.5,174.0],[1335.7,1424.2]]}],["2","y:7REkLQflH2g",1745928005,"x",null,null,{"d":1425,"sk":[[27.5,117.9],[1335.6,1424.2]]}],["1","y:w5WDThgmECA",1745841605,"x",null,null,{"d":1425,"sk":[[49.5,138.9]]}]],"pat":"ทุกวัน 19:00 น."},{"p":"muse_th","r":"TH","u":"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLIa05JMgYhhaBMri49iP-on12Nd-88JSo","lang":"dub","eps":[["12","y:6VxxAld4oRE",1761795044,"~",null,null,{"d":1425,"fin":1}],["9","y:Wt0Vjfer5ZY",1761795044,"~",null,null,{"d":1426,"sk":[[107.6,195.0],[1335.6,1424.1]]}],["10","y:8_UtMOzcqSM",1761795044,"~",null,null,{"d":1425,"sk":[[1367.2,1424.0]]}],["11","y:SSulmlWdnZ8",1761795044,"~",null,null,{"d":1425,"sk":[[1335.0,1424